# Pages

- Shell is `src/components/Base.astro`.
- Representative families: `/`, `/collections/[handle]`, `/products/[handle]`, `/search`, `/cart`, `/journal`, `/journal/[slug]`, `/pages/[slug]`, `/pages/shops`, `/pages/shops/[slug]`, `404`.
- Do not add a remote form action or a checkout endpoint.
